# Giphy API key for the GIF picker. Create a free one at https://developers.giphy.com/ (type "API").
# Giphy retired the public key Ghostly used to fall back to, so without a key here
# users are asked for their own in the picker or in Settings. Release builds take it
# from the VITE_GIPHY_API_KEY repository secret.
VITE_GIPHY_API_KEY=
